                            <!-- Task 76: the stacked RUN iT lockup, 220pt wide at its own
                                 882:517 aspect ratio, horizontally centred and 28pt above true
                                 centre — exactly where SplashScreen
                                 (lib/features/splash/presentation/splash_screen.dart) draws the same
                                 lockup: a 220pt-wide image (129pt tall) followed by 24+2+12+18=56pt
                                 below it, all centred as one 185pt block, puts the image's centre
                                 (185/2 - 129/2) = 28pt above the screen's. Re-running
                                 `dart run flutter_native_splash:create` regenerates this storyboard
                                 from scratch (image pinned full-screen) — restore these four
                                 constraints and the LaunchImage resource size below if that happens,
                                 and re-run tool/generate_brand_assets.py for the crisp @1x/2x/3x
                                 LaunchImage PNGs. (Replaces Task 28's 92pt badge geometry.) -->
